## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical ability to design a customer-initiated data export flow using native Azure services with privacy, auditing, and cost controls. It gauges understanding of tenant isolation, secure data transfer, and disaster recovery.

## Key Concepts

- Azure Data Lake Gen2, Delta Lake, per-tenant isolation
- Durable Functions for orchestration
- SAS-based secure transfer to customer Data Lake Gen2
- Purview cataloging, RBAC, and Log Analytics auditing
- Cost governance: quotas, tiering, DR in paired region

